hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1747","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: Kharch karo, tum par kharch kya jaaeyga. Aur farmaya: Allah ka haath bhara hua hai, kharch usey kam nahi karta. Raat aur din behney wala hai. Aur farmaya: Kya tum ne dekha jo us ne kharch kya jab se aasmaan aur zameen paida kiye? Beshak uskey haath mein jo hai wo kam nahi hua. Aur uska Arsh paani par tha. Aur uskey haath mein taraazu hai, neecha karta hai aur uncha karta hai. (Bukhari: 4684). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur aise hi tumhaarey Rab ki pakad hai jab wo bastiyon ko pakadta hai)."
"1748","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah zaalim ko mohlat deta hai yahan tak ke jab use pakadta hai to use nahi chhorta. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir Aap ne padha: (Aur aise hi tumhaarey Rab ki pakad hai jab wo bastiyon ko pakadta hai jabke wo zaalim hain. Beshak uski pakad dardnaak sakht hai). (Bukhari: 4686). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Magar jo kaan laga kar suney to uskey peechey roshan shoala lagta hai)."
